dialect protocol
protocol din18599.mutations
version 1
schema norm.din18599.mutations
start record
framing record

# Real op frame (`dsl::variants_binary::encode_tagged_op`): `format u8` (`OP_BINARY_FORMAT`) then `tag varint`,
# then the kind's framework record body (`os_pack::encode_record_body`). Each record is one mutation kind at its
# wire tag; this file is the only source of those tags, which the codec looks up by the kind's keyword.
header fixed 2
field format u8
field tag varint
record change-use-class tag=0
field payload bytes
record change-heated-area-m2 tag=1
field payload bytes
record change-occupants tag=2
field payload bytes
record change-ht tag=3
field payload bytes
record change-hv tag=4
field payload bytes
record change-internal-gains-wm2 tag=5
field payload bytes
record change-solar-gains-kwh tag=6
field payload bytes
record change-system-losses-kwh tag=7
field payload bytes
record change-renewable-kwh tag=8
field payload bytes
record change-annual-limit-kwh tag=9
field payload bytes
record change-energy-carrier tag=10
field payload bytes
record change-reference-qp-kwh tag=11
field payload bytes
record update-climate tag=12
field payload bytes
